    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f87aacc881aeb67",
      "translationZh": "众所周知，使用 LLM 进行知识图谱提取成本高昂，主要是因为实体提取和关系推断的次数无穷无尽。我想看看 Jev 能否在保持准确率的同时降低成本和延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2240b82a362b2be",
      "translationZh": "我们从 FewRel 1.0 train_wiki 中固定选取了 160 个正例：16 种关系 × 每种 10 个案例，随机种子为 17。Jev、GPT-5.6 Luna 和 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 使用了相同的案例、选项、顺序和评分方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d747d1b641662dc2",
      "translationZh": "在按顺序、每次请求处理一个案例的情况下，Jev 的速度是 DeepSeek 的 2.9 倍，是 Luna 的 3.9 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8ac61fda935801b",
      "translationZh": "每 100 次计划决策的成本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d745e36f47f5462",
      "translationZh": "准确率，将未覆盖的案例计为错误：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf2aefc50083bc6e",
      "translationZh": "所以，结果并不是“Jev 全面胜出”。它在这项任务上确实快得多、便宜得多，但也确实存在准确率上的取舍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f79ad301db91793a",
      "translationZh": "感谢 Llamaindex 的 DocJev 工作，为我们的上游流水线提供了补充！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
